        "original_id": "b2371e12-65db-51ed-bdcb-33c2efc26175",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pekka Markkanen, Eero Markkanen, Lauri Markkanen, Miikka Markkanen, Riikka Markkanen\n- Organizations: Chicago Bulls, AIK, Dynamo Dresden, Finland national football team\n- Roles: basketball player, footballer, striker\n- Places: Pori, Finland\n\nFacts:\n- Pekka Juha Markkanen was born on May 28, 1967, in Pori, Finland.\n- Pekka Markkanen is a Finnish former professional basketball player.\n- Riikka Markkanen, née Ellonen, was also a basketball player.\n- Eero Pekka Sakari Markkanen was born on July 3, 1991.\n- Eero Markkanen is a Finnish footballer who plays as a striker for Dynamo Dresden on loan from AIK and for the Finland national football team.\n- Pekka Markkanen is the father of Chicago Bulls basketball player Lauri Markkanen and AIK football player Eero Markkanen.\n- Miikka Markkanen also played basketball before retiring early because of injuries.\n- Eero Markkanen is the son of former basketball player Pekka Markkanen and the older brother of Chicago Bulls player Lauri Markkanen.",
